WEBVTT

00:51:57.167 --> 00:52:00.643
Do you figure that there's five others
that are doing something similar?

00:52:00.667 --> 00:52:02.643
Would you ever think about joining them?

00:52:02.667 --> 00:52:05.643
Or everybody needs
their own little plaquette?

00:52:05.667 --> 00:52:09.059
AG: I mean that's not passion to me,
that's just grandiosity, right?

00:52:09.083 --> 00:52:10.601
Like you couldn't be satisfied

00:52:10.625 --> 00:52:14.434
just maybe changing a country
or helping a billion people

00:52:14.458 --> 00:52:16.351
as opposed to over 7 billion, right?

00:52:16.375 --> 00:52:19.059
That just seems like
a ridiculous scale to aspire to.

00:52:19.083 --> 00:52:21.226
EP: But where's the limit?

00:52:21.250 --> 00:52:23.226
Grandiosity is a part of passion

00:52:23.250 --> 00:52:25.059
because when you experience passion,

00:52:25.083 --> 00:52:28.309
you experience yourself
as irrepressible, right?

00:52:28.333 --> 00:52:30.393
That is part of the experience of passion.